{
  "id": "ai4sgExtract0001",
  "name": "AI4SG · 3 Extraction & Interpretation (Skill: extraction)",
  "active": false,
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 3 · Extraction & Interpretation (runs the Extraction Skill)\nTakes pending items from the `sources` queue (found by AI or submitted by experts) → fetches full text → extracts field by field following the **Extraction Skill** (the experts' interpretation framework: cost, benefit, beneficiaries, strength of evidence, etc.).\nThe prompt also includes **gold examples extracted by the experts themselves**, so the model follows their conventions.\nEvery field must cite the source (original local-language sentence + English translation); **Verify Evidence** checks each quote really occurs in the text and lowers confidence if not.\nAll results are stored as `pending_review` and only count once an expert confirms them on the audit page.",
        "width": 2000,
        "height": 144,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "daecb4d9-990c-5ce1-8f82-32714d16aa1a",
      "name": "Note · overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -40,
        -314
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 🧑‍🔬 Expert entry point B\n**Extraction Skill** = the experts' focus and priors (e.g. emphasis on cost / benefit) written as field definitions and judgement rules;\n**Gold examples** = extractions the experts made by hand in the Expert Hub. Both are maintained by the experts.",
        "width": 460,
        "height": 170,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "d8ace142-bb34-5e68-9ec1-9bdc75f9beca",
      "name": "Hook · rubric",
